{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Lilia continues to draw symbols on the ground","created_at":"2020-08-21T06:58:12.382000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746261860348854273","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"\"You've been on this island for some time correct? I've only been hear a year, this place is very dangerous.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:01:14.261000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746262623204540477","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"a little over seven years\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:01:45.350000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746262753601257513","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"She nods \"How did you get here? I don't think I've heard the story.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:03:08.708000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746263103230181466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"Well I had a couple details filled in from the library\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:04:54.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746263547293597787","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"One of my parents was sibling to the king of Iberia, wherever that is. I guess I was a deer then too cause they were told to kill me cause 'witchcraft' but paid privateers to take me to London instead.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:06:40.477000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746263991453614110","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"Those privateers tried to get paid twice. They were going to hand me over to the king. The woman in the hold next to me decided to turn me into what I was accused of. She taught me how to spell-stitch. When we heard what they were doing she broke a bar, I could fit through. She told me to get on one of the lifeboats and as soon as I did the ropes that held it broke, I hit my head when that happened and woke up here. She told me to hide, the deer seemed good at that so I started to hide like they did and one of them took me in.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:09:11.282000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746264623975497788","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Selene is brewing something in one of the cauldrons","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:11:00.212000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746265080861032478","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Soon smells of cocoa, coffee, and cardamom reach you","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:11:36.500000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746265233064067142","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Lilia looks at Selene \"I see. I'm sorry that happened to you, but I'm glad I got to meet you though.\" She smiles at the spell of the cocoa","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:12:36.840000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-21T07:12:44.539000Z","id":"746265486148239431","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Selene sort of shrugs","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:13:07.392000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746265614292877343","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"It's all I know.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:13:13.822000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746265641261989912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"Do they have places with more books, books that will teach more magic?\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:13:36.333000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746265735679967243","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"\"If you are able to go back to London, there definitely are.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:14:21.700000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746265925962956850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"I think they want to kill me for witchcraft there?\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:16:31.888000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746266472011268117","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"\"They might not remember you anymore. But you are a Lady, you could easily have bodyguards if you ever want to go back to Europe.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:17:41.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746266763095965797","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"Why didn't that help last time? I think if that guy is still king it wouldn't work?\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:18:41.134000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746267014108151838","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"And it may not be a good idea, his son is going to die and they say it is from a witch...\"|| (historically accurate for Pillip the IV's son)","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:19:30.451000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746267220958773338","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Lilia shrugs \"I am out of touch with the current politics in Europe, so I don't really know.\" She pauses \"However. You might be able to find something on the mainland  as well.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:21:04.495000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746267615407767592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"My parents were trying to send me to london to be safe so maybe it would be. I wonder if they are friends with Iberia?\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:21:49.475000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746267804067430410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"\"It's possible.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:24:04.868000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746268371946963084","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"She pauses and says a prayer setting the glyph in place","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:27:39.863000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746269273701482537","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"What are the places like where they have the books you can learn magic from?\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:28:19.413000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746269439586074684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"\"Libraries and Colleges. We don't really have any here on this island. I'm sure you'd be able to find them on the mainland.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:29:39.305000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746269774677278751","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"In one of the romance novels they had a college. They have those for magic? Really?\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:32:00.771000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746270368028819466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"The college was my favorite part but they kept getting distracted with the mushy stuff.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:32:24.309000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746270466754215969","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"\"They really do. It's one of the most common places to learn magic if you don't want a boon from other sources.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:34:11.331000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746270915637149736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"I just want to learn. I have cast some things with scrolls I never new I could and I think there is more there. If I have learned this much with out a college I think with one. Maybe my friends would be safe. maybe finally...\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:36:35.059000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746271518476075028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Lilia smiles \"You are very bright. I think at a college you would probably try to learn everything you could.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:38:03.561000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746271889680236555","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Selene offers you a mug of cocoa-fee","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:38:22.422000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746271968789004310","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Lilia takes it happily","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:39:45.907000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746272318950735912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"Did I die today? I didn't remember anything past today and now I do. I didn't know why...\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:42:14.588000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746272942563917834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Lilia finishs the first glyph then looks at Selene \"Yes you did... but I brought you back. I usually ask someone if they are ok with that sort of thing, so I'm sorry I didn't with you. But I didn't want to lose you, I enjoy our quiet moments.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:44:33.559000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746273525450539060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Selene offers a soft laugh ||\"I don't think I mind...\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:45:17.691000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-21T07:46:42.439000Z","id":"746273710553432067","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"A thought seems to occur to Selene but they instead say ||\"You do different magic than me...\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:45:56.458000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746273873154015326","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"\"I am able to do so because of the Raven Queen. I am a cleric.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:46:47.289000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746274086354681906","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"\"Becuase I do her work here, she grates me the ability to do my magic.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:47:13.769000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746274197419982869","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"I guess I owe you both then.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:47:36.737000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746274293754626169","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"She smiles \"I don't wished to be owed anything. But if you would like to thank the Raven Queen, you can offer her a momento.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:48:47.931000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746274592364036176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"Where do I give it to her?\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:49:30.271000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746274769950736444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"She thinks for a moment. \"When she comes to accept a momento, she sends a crow or raven to collect it. There are a few that live by my home. Otherwise you could try praying to her and see if one appears.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:52:08.020000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746275431597998131","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Selene smiles","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:52:34.703000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746275543514611752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"\"But the item needs to hold stong sentimental value. Monetary value isn't important in these things.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:53:13.262000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746275705242910792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"Would she like a thunderbird feather? Or some cocoa? If I were her I would be really happy with cocoa but it isn't a momento cause you drink it and it's gone I guess...\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:53:39.953000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746275817193209886","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"\"What memory does the thunderbird feather hold?\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:54:26.006000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746276010353491999","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"brb","created_at":"2020-08-21T07:57:03.366000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746276670369169458","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"A test with the thunderbird. I didn't die that time...\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T08:02:15.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746277980065628280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"My old dress maybe?\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T08:03:22.524000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746278260672954408","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"||\"It has the most memories of anything I own...\"||","created_at":"2020-08-21T08:03:39.686000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746278332655599636","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
